   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Labour Organization (ILO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved institutional capacity for protection of all workers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO programme in Qatar has a broad agenda on the issue of the protection of rights. In some areas, such as wage protection and occupational safety and health, there is already legislation in place and the focus will be on building institutional capacity and effective implementation and enforcement. Other areas are of focus during the biennium will include  social protection, where work will be carried out to explore potential reforms to the systems for end-of-service benefits and compensation for work-related injuries and illnesses; and also support the roll-out of the already adopted reforms on health insurance for migrant workers.</narrative>
  </description>
